source_syntax:
AMP=(subparameter)
AMP=('subparameter[,subparameter]...')

AMP='subparameter[,subparameter]...'

The subparameters are:

     ACCBIAS= [USER  ]
              [SYSTEM]
              [DO    ]
              [DW    ]
              [SO    ]
              [SW    ]
     AMORG
     BUFND=number
     BUFNI=number
     BUFSP=bytes
     CROPS=  {RCK}
             {NCK}
             {NRE}
             {NRC}

     FRLOG=  {NONE}
             {REDO}

     MSG=SMBBIAS

     OPTCD=  {I }
             {L }
             {IL}

     RECFM=  {F }
             {FB}
             {V }
             {VB}

     RMODE31=[ALL ]
             [BUFF]
             [CB ]
             [None]

     SMBDFR= {Y | N}
     SMBHWT= nn
     SMBVSP= {nnK | nnM}
     SMBVSPI= {nnK | nnM}
     STRNO=number
     SYNAD=modulename
     TRACE

OUTPUT= {reference                 }
        {(reference[,reference]...)}

A reference is one of the following:

    *.name
    *.stepname.name
    *.stepname.procstepname.name

The NOTIFY parameter for both JES2 and JES3 is the following:

NOTIFY={nodename.userid}
       {userid         }

//JOBB JOB  ,S-M-TU
//JOBC JOB  ,.ABC
//JOBD JOB  ,P.F.M
//JOBE JOB  ,'BUILD/PAUL'
//JOBF JOB  ,'MAE BIRDSALL'
